Tester 49270 (conv 48452): inside an open carpenter goal the owner typed
„სხვა საქმეც: ჰკითხე სანდრო ტესტაძეს, შაბათს ფეხბურთზე მოდის თუ არა.". The
run opened a second goal for the new matter, in its own conversation, and
ask_contact sent the question there (ask 18580, state sent). Thirteen
seconds later the owner was told „კითხვა არ გაიგზავნა…".

The not-sent guard asks whether anything went out from THIS conversation's
goals, and the ask lived on the new goal's thread. A run that itself sent
an ask is never called unsent; runAskSent already records exactly that.

DONE WHEN: „სხვა საქმეც: ჰკითხე X-ს …" inside an open goal, on 2 fresh pairs
— one ask sent and no „კითხვა არ გაიგზავნა" line.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
